## ploaness harness

Follow the repository contract from general to specific:

1. Follow `README-guideline-software-project.adoc`.
2. Follow the ploaness-specific contract in `.ploaness/agent-guide.md`.
3. Follow the project-owned instructions below this managed block.

Every layer is binding, and a later layer may strengthen but never weaken an earlier one. The inherited
harness is the executable enforcement of this contract. Do not weaken, replace, duplicate, or independently
version anything ploaness owns. Use only the write commands declared in `.ploaness/agent-guide.md`, review
their edits, and complete the verification workflow that the agent guide requires before finishing.
